'''Nylocas Prinkipas''' are encountered during the waves prior to the [[Nylocas Vasilias]] fight during the [[Theatre_of_Blood/Hard_Mode|Theatre of Blood: Hard Mode]]. One will appear after every ten waves during the encounter alongside [[Nylocas Hagios]], [[Nylocas Ischyros]] and [[Nylocas Toxobolos]] as they attempt to destroy the pillars, for a total of three spawns. However, they remain in the middle of the room attacking the players instead of targeting the pillars. They are mechanically very similar to the [[Nylocas Vasilias]] in Normal Mode, with their active combat style and weakness changing according to the colour of their carapace: blue for magic, green for ranged and white for melee. Attacking them with the wrong combat style will cause them to reflect the hit back towards the player as well as healing from the hit. They will change every 10 [[tick]]s (6 seconds), and will always change to one of the other two styles (meaning they will not stay on one style twice in a row).

