==Trivia==
*The word "Nylocas" is very similar to the Hungarian word "Nyolcas", meaning "eight", referencing the eight legs of this arachnid-like creature.
*The latter part of the name of the Nylocas Prinkipas likely derives from the Greek term "πρίγκιπας" ("prínkipas"), meaning "prince", referencing the fact that the creature is stronger than the other Nylocas, but weaker than the "Vasilias", whose name is derived from the Greek word for "king".


